 genre of the person who drinks mirinda?**  \n   → Person 2 drinks mirinda → movie genre = superhero  \n   Answer: superhero\n\n2. **At what position is the person who drinks mirinda?**  \n   → Person 2  \n   Answer: 2\n\n3. **What movie genre does the person who listens to classical watch?**  \n   → Person 1 listens to classical → movie = spy  \n   Answer: spy\n\n4. **What music genre does the person who drinks cola listen to?**  \n   → Person 1 drinks cola → music = classical  \n   Answer: classical\n\nSo the four answers in order are:\nsuperhero, 2, spy, classical\n\nFinal answer format:\n\n<solution>superhero, 2, spy, classical</solution>  \nFinal answer: superhero, 2, spy, classical", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.03804187476634979}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.0789945125579834}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -0.5759409070014954}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -1.176953673362732}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -5.400034933700226e-05}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.005405571311712265}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0009158230968751013}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.005328737199306488}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.036520496010780334}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.1167219877243042}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.008649740368127823}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.0009117737063206732}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.018149960786104202}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.023257210850715637}, {"token": " Each", "logprob": -0.2015266716480255}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.014163684099912643}, {"token": " unique", "logprob": -0.18049582839012146}, {"token": " values", "logprob": -0.00047291061491705477}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.00026544384309090674}, {"token": " 